836:
Except as provided in section 44-25, all pawnbroker licenses in this section may be renewed by payment of the required fees provided:
(1) Applications for renewal of existing licenses are made in person by the applicants at the office of the city clerk. Such license fee shall be payable January 1 of each year and shall be delinquent if not paid by April 1 of each year;
